=====Usage notes=====
The usage of ''man'' as a pronoun originally died out in the 15th century. It has independently reappeared in Multicultural London English. There it is most commonly used as a first person pronoun or as an indefinite personal pronoun, but uses in the second and third person are also attested.<ref name="Cheshire"/>

